<p>Bas Ali(a.s) ne ki dua aye Khuda<br />
Mujhko ek Sher sa beta ho ata</p>

<p>Ya Abbas(a.s) Ya Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>Aye Tamanna e Murtaza(a.s) Abbas(a.s)<br />
Tum ho bekas ka Aasra Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>1. Pyaase Bacche ye roke kehte hain<br />
Paani le aayiye chacha Abbas(a.s)<br />
Aye Tamanna e Murtaza(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>2. Boli Zainab(s.a) madad ko aajao<br />
Chin rahi hai meri rida Abbas(a.s)<br />
Aye Tamanna e Murtaza(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>3. Kyun na hum fatahe furaat kahe'n<br />
Jab hai Qabze me alqama'n Abbas(a.s)<br />
Aye Tamanna e Murtaza(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>4. Pyaase baccho ki aas toot gayi<br />
Mashk par teer jab laga Abbas(a.s)<br />
Aye Tamanna e Murtaza(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>5. Fatima(s.a) ne kaha tha tujhko pisar<br />
Kyun ke de gayi'n tuhe dua Abbas(a.s)<br />
Aye Tamanna e Murtaza(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>
<center><h3>Kalaam : Janaab Jaffer Sahab</h3></center></p>
